  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-flomo",
      "text": "> **English** | [**中文**](README.zh.md)\n\nSend notes, memos, and summaries straight into [flomo](https://flomo.app) (浮墨笔记) from DeepSeek Harness. Configure your flomo API URL or API Key once, then any agent can record ideas via the `flomo_send` tool."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **Settings panel** — configure the API URL / API Key from the web GUI: Settings → Flomo. Save, test, clear, and a quick-send box.\n- **flomo_send** — write a memo with optional tags (`tags` become `#tags`), supporting `**bold**` and `` inline syntax. Tags go through the `tags` argument; any ASCII `#` left in the body is escaped to the full-width `＃` before sending, so flomo never parses body text as a tag (pass `escapeBodyHashes: false` to keep an inline `#tag`).\n- **flomo_config** — set `apiKey` (newer key format) or `webhookUrl` (the API URL from the flomo settings page, typically `https://flomoapp.com/iwh/<token>/`); `reset: true` clears the credential.\n- **flomo_status** — report whether the plugin is configured and where the credential lives, without echoing the full key.\n- Credential persisted to `~/.dsh/dsh-flomo.json` with mode `0600`.\n- System-prompt announcement so agents know when to use the plugin."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "after publishing to GitHub (repo tagged with the `dsh-plugin` topic)",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:zhengjy01/dsh-flomo"
    },
    {
      "section": "local development",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add link:/path/to/dsh-flomo\n```\n\nRestart `dsh web`. The plugin needs no build step — `lib/index.js` is plain ESM."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "Get your API URL at <https://flomoapp.com/mine?source=incoming_webhook>. Then either paste it into the plugin's `cordis.patch.yml` config, or let the agent configure it for you:\n\n```text\n帮我配置 flomo，API URL 是 https://flomoapp.com/iwh/xxxx/\n```\n\nThe agent calls `flomo_config` with your `webhookUrl` (or `apiKey`) and persists it to `~/.dsh/dsh-flomo.json` (mode `0600`). From then on:\n\n```text\n把这句话记到 flomo：#ideas\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "> The flomo API URL is a credential: anyone with it can write memos to your flomo. Keep it private; use `flomo_config(reset: true)` to clear it if it leaks."
    },
    {
      "section": "Notes",
      "text": "- Sending uses Node's built-in `fetch` (Node 22+), no extra dependencies.\n- The web settings panel talks to the host through the loopback-only `/api/dsh-flomo` route family.\n- Respects flomo's content syntax: `**bold**`, ``; tags are appended from `tags`, and body ASCII `#` is escaped to `＃` so it can never spawn a stray tag."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
